The '''Alert Flare''' is a {{Rare}} [[Deployables|Deployable]]. It is unlocked at {{CollectionLink|Blaze Slayer VI}} and can be upgraded into an {{Item|SOS Flare}}. Healing effect only working on [[Crimson Isle]] and [[Kuudra]].

